  "description": "Export DataGridView data to Excel, CSV, JSON, PDF and Text formats. Also Export Unique And duplicate Data,can search value in DatagridView.\t\n\t\n\t##In Your Application:\n\tusing DataGridViewExport; ## Add this line on Top.\n\tnamespace yourapp\n\t{\n\t   public partial class Form1 : Form\n\t   {       \n\t       public Form1()\n\t       {\n\t         InitializeComponent();\n\t\t\t GridMenu.Attach(dataGridView1);\n\t\t\t ##Add this above line and pass your DataGridView Control Name.\n\t       }\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t#Now Right Click on Datagridview control,Export Menu will appear on screen.\n\t\n\tFeatures:\n\t- Excel/CSV/JSON/TEXT/PDF export\n\t- Unique row export\n\t- Duplicate row export\n\t- DataGridView search\n\t- Right-click export menu\n\t- Easy DataGridView integration",
